/post/customs-value.description:
Are you doing cross-border trade with a non-EU country, or are you planning to do cross-border trade with a non-EU country in that case this blog may be of great interest to you. In this blog, I will discuss customs valuation. This will cover the following aspects:
 - customs value in general;
 - the methods for calculating the customs value;
 - The most common method;
 - The importance of a correct customs value.

The customs value in general
